### 9.2 Data Migration Service

#### [NEW] [DataMigrationService.java](file:///d:/Projects/Project%20AURA/final-project/backend/src/main/java/com/aura/service/DataMigrationService.java)

One-time migration for existing data without tenant IDs:

```java
@Service
public class DataMigrationService {
    @Autowired private MongoTemplate mongoTemplate;
    private static final Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(DataMigrationService.class);

    @PostConstruct
    public void migrateExistingData() {
        String defaultTenant = "TEN-DEFAULT0";

        // Count documents without tenant_id
        long usersWithout = mongoTemplate.count(
            Query.query(Criteria.where("tenant_id").exists(false)), "users");

        if (usersWithout == 0) {
            log.info("[Migration] No migration needed — all documents have tenant_id");
            return;
        }

        log.info("[Migration] Found {} users without tenant_id. Assigning '{}'",
            usersWithout, defaultTenant);

        // Assign default tenant to all collections
        for (String collection : List.of("users", "requests", "donor_bookings", "inventory", "prolog_analysis")) {
            mongoTemplate.updateMulti(
                Query.query(Criteria.where("tenant_id").exists(false)),
                Update.update("tenant_id", defaultTenant),
                collection
            );
        }

        log.info("[Migration] Migration complete.");
    }
}
```

